# Goblin Surveyor's "Trample" (CR 702.19b): blocked by a 1/1 Memnite, the 3/2 Surveyor assigns lethal damage (1) to it and the rest
# (2) to Bot2, 20 -> 18; without trample Bot2 would take nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Goblin Surveyor
Island x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Goblin Surveyor.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Goblin Surveyor > Bot2)
Bot2.Block(Memnite > Goblin Surveyor)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 18
Bot2.Graveyard = Memnite
